      "content": "Wait, why would we acknowledge a \"shipping issue\"? The sensor logs I mentioned earlier clearly show the carrier handled the package perfectly. If we tell the customer it was a shipping error, aren't we just lying to them to make them go away? Isn't that a risk if they realize we're just making up excuses?",
